-2","ko":"죄송하지만, 그 구두가 인기 상품이라 230 사이즈는 품절이에요.","zh":"很抱歉，那款鞋是热销款，230码已经卖完了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송하지만,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구두가","meaning":"皮鞋","explanation":"구두：皮鞋；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"구두","audio":"/audio/0053d9a2905615031142.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26805","senseId":"1","lemma":"구두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인기","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상품이라","meaning":"商品","explanation":"상품：商品；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"상품","audio":"/audio/cd75437c97e691144222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83175","senseId":"1","lemma":"상품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"230","meaning":"230：数字。","explanation":"230：数字。","readings":[{"term":"230","audio":"/audio/a0eaec5a55dc2f5b2ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"사이즈는","meaning":"尺寸，号，尺码","explanation":"사이즈：尺寸，号，尺码；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사이즈","audio":"/audio/e0511ad24076321c499a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61226","senseId":"1","lemma":"사이즈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"품절이에요.","meaning":"售完，缺货，脱销","explanation":"품절：售完，缺货，脱销；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"품절","audio":"/audio/8b407f29e4b61b0d1440.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88465","senseId":"1","lemma":"품절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"656cf